    q: 'Is it normal to pay a deposit before restoration work starts?',
    a: 'Emergency water removal is often started without a large deposit, and the Texas Department of Insurance says to be wary if a contractor asks for a large or full down payment. It also notes that after a disaster it is against the law for out-of-town contractors to ask for a down payment before they start.',
  },
